        <div class="cap">Beyond the referral cut</div>
        <h3>When you'd rather earn the whole sale, not a slice</h3>
        <p>Affiliate income is a share of someone else's sale, and it will always be a share. The alternative isn't a better commission rate — it's owning the thing being sold, so the whole price lands with you instead of a slice of it. The same content that sends an affiliate click can send a buyer to something that's yours.</p>
        <span class="anno">your cut, not a fraction of it →</span>
